@* This code creates a web page for editing a coach's application.
What it does:
•	Uses the CoachApplicationModel to fill in the form fields.
•	Displays a form with fields for:
•	First Name
•	Last Name
•	Date of Birth
•	Years of Experience
•	Selected Sport (dropdown, options from ViewBag.Sports)
•	Selected Role (dropdown, options from ViewBag.Roles)
•	Includes a hidden field for the coach's ID.
•	Has a "Save" button to submit the form.
In short:
This page lets users update a coach's details, choose their sport and role, and save the changes. *@